<title>ZIMBABWE: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 2ND INNS 107-5 V ENGLAND - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE 2ND INNS 107-5 V ENGLAND - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BULAWAYO, Zimbabwe 1996-12-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe, 30 behind England on first innings, were 107-5 at the close on the fourth day of the first test at Queen's Club on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 376 and 107-5, England 406.</p>
</text>
